","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids September to October, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025, January to February landed at 22% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 63% of normal on the middle. Grid 27750 had its driest year in 1989 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
